Package: schema-init
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, python3
Recommends: curl, libglib2.0-bin, procps
Description: custom Linux init system (PID 1 replacement)
 schema-init is a small init system and service supervisor, with a
 control tool, journal sink, recorder and a Raspberry Pi boot wrapper
 that keeps a known-good copy to fall back on.
 .
 Installing the package never changes PID 1; run "schema-pi enable" to
 opt in on a Raspberry Pi.
